1
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:06,030
-Hi! -Hey!
-嗨 -嘿

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,640
So, what's the final head count on my baby shower?
有多少人會來參加 寶寶的歡迎會？

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,710
About twenty. Couple people from work had something else to do.
大約有20個人 有些同事有事沒辦法來

4
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:14,840
Your sisters called and can't make it.
你的妹妹們打電話來說她們沒辦法來

5
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:17,710
What? You mean they're not coming to a social event..
什麼？ 你說她們不來參加…

6
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:22,150
where there's no men and no booze? That's shocking.
沒有男人跟酒的社交聚會？ 那真的是太稀奇了

7
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,280
I don't care, as long as my mom's here.
我不在乎，只要我媽能來就行了

8
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:28,450
-Oh, my God. Your mother. -What? My mom's not gonna be here?
-天啊，你媽 -什麼？我媽不會來嗎？

9
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:33,290
Well, given that we forgot to invite her, it would be a big coincidence if she was.
說不定我們忘了邀請她 反而能讓她鬆口氣

10
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,720
My God!
我的天啊

11
00:00:35,930 --> 00:00:38,690
Phoebe was in charge of the invitations.
不是我的錯 菲比負責發請帖的

12
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:41,600
I don't have a mother. So often I forget..
我沒有媽媽 所以我常忘了…

13
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,170
Oh, give it a rest.
得了吧

14
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:47,570
So my mother is not coming to my baby shower?
我媽媽不來參加 寶寶的歡迎會？

15
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,110
No.
對

16
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,410
Neither is mine.
我媽也不會來

17
00:00:52,610 --> 00:00:57,070
We'll take care of it. We'll call her. You go home and get ready.
我們會處理的，我們會打電話給她 你先回家做準備

18
00:00:57,250 --> 00:01:00,780
Make sure she comes. It's important. It's my mom.
確定她一定會來 這很重要，她是我媽

19
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:04,080
-I know. What's her number? -I don't know.
-我知道，她電話號碼幾號？ -我不知道

20
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:07,280
Go. I have it in my book. Go.
你去吧，我記在我的電話簿裡了

21
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:16,840
If you're in charge of invitations, why am I calling her?
如果你負責寄請帖 為什麼是我打電話給她？

22
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:20,100
Hello, Mrs. Green! Hi, it's Monica Geller.
喂，葛林太太 嗨，我是摩妮卡蓋勒

23
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:21,940
-Oh, hello, Monica. -Hi.
-哈囉，摩妮卡 -嗨

24
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:26,010
It's last-minute, but we've decided to throw an impromptu..
這是緊急通知 我們打算在今天…

25
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:30,150
-baby shower for Rachel today. -My daughters told me..
-幫瑞秋的寶寶辦歡迎會 -我的女兒們已經告訴我了…

26
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:34,980
when they received their impromptu invitations a month ago.
她們在一個月前 就接到歡迎會的請帖

27
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:38,750
-Okay, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. -For what, dear?
-好吧，我很抱歉 -為什麼呢？親愛的

28
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:41,990
For not inviting me, or for lying about it?
為了沒有邀請我 還是你說謊騙我呢？

29
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:46,260
Oh, my God! My ass is sweating.
天啊，我的屁股在流汗

30
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:48,600
I'm sorry for everything. Really, I mean..
我為所有的事道歉 真的，我是說…

31
00:01:48,770 --> 00:01:51,140
there's a lot of planning in a baby shower.
計劃寶寶的歡迎會 真的累人

32
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:54,000
You know, things get overlooked and..
我們會忘了一些事 還有…

33
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,410
Phoebe's mother killed herself.
菲比的媽媽自殺了

34
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,840
Why? Did you forget to invite her too?
為什麼？ 你們也忘了邀請她？

35
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:04,040
Oh, you're so funny.
你真是幽默

36
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:09,520
Please, please, can you come? It starts at 4:00.
拜託，你能來嗎？ 歡迎會四點開始

37
00:02:10,530 --> 00:02:14,150
-Well, all right. I'll see you at 4. -Thank you.
-好吧，四點見 -謝謝

38
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:20,120
-Isn't it at 3? -Son of a bitch!
-不是三點開始嗎？ -混蛋

39
00:02:20,340 --> 00:02:22,365
The One With The Baby Shower
本集播出：寶寶歡迎會

00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:24,365
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

40
00:02:57,570 --> 00:02:59,400
Hey, Joe! Wanna shoot some hoops?
喬伊，你要去打籃球嗎？

41
00:02:59,570 --> 00:03:02,370
And for the record, I am not covering the tall one this time.
我得告訴你 這次我不要防守那個高個子

42
00:03:02,540 --> 00:03:05,170
Fine, but she's not that tall.
好吧，但她沒有那麼高

43
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:10,010
I can't go. I'm practicing. I got an audition to be the host of a new game show.
我不能去，我在練習 我要參加新遊戲節目主持人的試鏡

44
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,240
-Cool! -Great!
-酷啊 -太棒了

45
00:03:11,490 --> 00:03:14,650
If I get it, by day I'll be Dr. Drake Ramoray.
如果我能當上主持人 白天我是德瑞克拉莫瑞醫生

46
00:03:14,820 --> 00:03:18,850
But by night I'll be Joey Tribbiani!
但晚上我是喬伊崔比亞尼

47
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:21,960
You'll be perfect for this! That's already your name!
你非常適合這份工作 節目名稱跟你的名字一樣

48
00:03:22,130 --> 00:03:23,360
I know. I know.
我知道

49
00:03:23,530 --> 00:03:27,160
It'd be great if I got this because you never know what could happen on a soap.
我能夠得到這份工作是最好的 因為誰都不知道演肥皂劇結果會怎麼樣

50
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:29,240
But I could be a game-show host forever.
但我可以一輩子 當遊戲節目主持人

51
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:34,340
Like that Bob Barker guy. He's been doing The Price is Right for 75 years.
就像巴伯貝克 他主持猜價遊戲75年

52
00:03:35,140 --> 00:03:37,300
I bet the ratings weren't good for the first 25.
我敢說前25年的收視率 一定不太好

53
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:39,380
You know, before there was television.
那時根本沒有電視機

54
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:43,680
But the problem, this game is really complicated.
問題是 這項遊戲真的很複雜

55
00:03:43,850 --> 00:03:46,620
Come on. You said the same thing about Hungry Hungry Hippos.
少來了 你也那麼說飢餓河馬

56
00:03:46,790 --> 00:03:48,620
And last week, you beat Ben.
上星期你贏了班

57
00:03:48,790 --> 00:03:51,920
Yeah. I have to be honest with you guys.
對 我得跟你們承認

58
00:03:52,090 --> 00:03:53,860
He kind of let me win.
他有點放水讓我贏

59
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:57,830
The audition's in a couple hours, and I don't understand the game.
再過幾小時就要試鏡 我搞不懂這個遊戲

60
00:03:58,130 --> 00:03:59,430
Do you want some help?
你需要幫忙嗎？

61
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:04,260
Oh, really? That'd be great. Hey, you guys can be the contestants!
真的嗎？那真的太棒了 你們可以當參賽者

62
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:07,910
We can lose to junior-high girls some other time.
我們可以下次 再去打敗國中女生

63
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:11,310
All right. Let's play Bamboozled!
好吧，我們來玩暈頭轉向

64
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,450
-Bamboozled? -Yeah. Isn't that a cool name?
-暈頭轉向？ -對，那個名字很酷吧？

65
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,840
-Yeah! -No!
-對 -不

66
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:19,350
All right. Okay. Our first contestant is Ross Geller.
好吧 第一位參賽者是羅斯蓋勒

67
00:04:19,550 --> 00:04:21,750
Tell us about yourself, Ross.
做個自我介紹吧，羅斯

68
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:26,620
Well, I'm a paleontologist. I live in New York.
我是古生物學家 我住在紐約

69
00:04:26,790 --> 00:04:31,700
I have a son, Ben. Hi, Ben! And..
我有個兒子叫做班，嗨，班，還有…

70
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,330
I said, a little bit, Ross. How about you, Chandler?
我叫你介紹一下自己，羅斯 你呢？錢德

71
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:39,530
I'm a headhunter. I hook up out-of-work Soviet scientists..
我是個尋人專家 我在找為卑鄙的第三世界國家…

72
00:04:39,710 --> 00:04:43,010
with rogue Third World nations. Hi, Rasputin.
失業的蘇聯科學家 嗨，拉斯普廷

73
00:04:43,210 --> 00:04:46,870
Excellent! Let's play! Chandler, you'll go first.
太棒了，我們開始吧 錢德，你先

74
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:49,880
-What is the capital of Colombia? -Bogota.
-哥倫比亞的首都在哪裡？ -波哥大

75
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:53,140
It's Bogota, but close enough.
是波格大，但很接近了

76
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:58,720
You can either pass your turn to Ross or pick a Wicked Wango Card.
可以把機會讓給羅斯 或挑魔法機會牌

77
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:02,990
-What does a Wicked Wango Card do? -I should know that.
-魔法機會牌可以做什麼？ -我早該知道的

78
00:05:04,170 --> 00:05:06,500
Let's see. One moment, please..
讓我看看，請等一下…

79
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:12,970
Here we are. A Wicked Wango Card determines if you go higher or lower.
好了，魔法機會牌 能決定你要向上或是向下

80
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:15,470
Higher or lower than what?
什麼東西向上或是向下？

81
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:20,980
-This is embarrassing! -Can you believe how lame this is?
-這真的是太丟臉了 -你能相信這有多爛嗎？

82
00:05:21,150 --> 00:05:26,520
I'm sorry. I don't believe contestants are allowed to talk to each other.
抱歉 我想參賽者不該交談

83
00:05:30,190 --> 00:05:34,180
I told the stripper to be here at 5. That's good, right?
我叫脫衣舞男五點要到 那很棒吧？

84
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:38,730
You ordered a stripper for the shower? That is inappropriate.
你請脫衣舞男來寶寶歡迎會？ 那太不適當了

85
00:05:38,930 --> 00:05:41,730
Why? He's gonna be dressed as a baby.
為什麼？他會打扮成寶寶的樣子

86
00:05:42,900 --> 00:05:46,530
Oh, hi, Mrs. Green. I'm so glad you could make it.
嗨，葛林太太 我很高興你趕來了

87
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:51,510
Thank you so much. We're so sorry. We could not feel worse about it.
謝謝你，我們很抱歉 我們真的很過意不去

88
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,240
Try.
試試看吧

89
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:56,210
There's my little girl!
我女兒在那邊

90
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:59,050
-She's still mad. -Yeah, I know.
-她還在生氣 -對，我知道

91
00:05:59,220 --> 00:06:02,450
Isn't it great? One less person to make small talk with.
那不是很棒嗎？ 少了一個人跟你咬耳朵

92
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,750
Hey, how are you?
你好嗎？

93
00:06:03,930 --> 00:06:05,790
Yeah, yeah. Okay, okay.
對，好吧

94
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:11,820
Phoebe, Sandra's mad at you too. It doesn't bother you?
菲比，珊卓拉也在生你的氣 你不會感到困擾嗎？

95
00:06:12,030 --> 00:06:15,730
We've apologized twice. I can't do any more than that.
我們道了兩次歉 我真的沒辦法了

96
00:06:15,900 --> 00:06:18,670
You hate it when people are mad at you..
你討厭 別人生你的氣…

97
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,970
but you just have to be okay with it.
但你得去 接受它

98
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:25,480
Okay. I can do that.
好吧，我辦得到

99
00:06:25,650 --> 00:06:28,910
-I gotta go powder my ass. -Oh.
-我得去幫我的屁股撲痱子粉 -喔

100
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:32,210
Look at that face! Just like when you were in high school.
看看你的臉 你跟念高中時還是一樣

101
00:06:32,390 --> 00:06:36,820
If I didn't know better, I'd say you were a cheerleader in trouble.
要不是我很瞭解你 我會以為你是個有麻煩的啦啦隊員

102
00:06:36,990 --> 00:06:38,690
-Come, let's get some tea. -Okay.
-來吧，我們去喝點茶 -好吧

103
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:42,020
Oh, my! Look at that. Only three weeks to go.
天啊，你看 只剩三星期了

104
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:46,930
Did you pick a nanny? If you use your housekeeper, it will split her focus.
你挑好奶媽了嗎？ 如果請管家兼職，她會分心的

105
00:06:47,100 --> 00:06:51,730
Actually, I'm not gonna use a nanny. And I don't have a housekeeper.
事實上我不請奶媽 我也沒有管家

106
00:06:51,940 --> 00:06:54,930
It's like you're a cave person.
你好像山頂洞人

107
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:59,780
You must get a nanny. You don't know how overwhelming it will be.
你得請個奶媽 你不知道帶孩子有多累

108
00:06:59,950 --> 00:07:03,250
When you were a baby, I had Mrs. K.
你小時候我僱用了K太太

109
00:07:03,450 --> 00:07:07,510
Mrs. K! Oh, yeah, she was sweet. She taught me Spanish.
K太太，對，她人真的很好 她教我西班牙文

110
00:07:07,690 --> 00:07:10,420
I actually think I remember some of it.
我想 我還記得一點

111
00:07:10,590 --> 00:07:14,390
Tu madre esta loca.
（西班牙文）

112
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,590
Such a sweet woman.
她真是個好人

113
00:07:17,770 --> 00:07:20,360
And more important, she became a part of our family.
更重要的是 她成為我們家的一部份

114
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:23,660
That's right, Mrs. K. What did that K stand for?
沒錯，K太太 她到底姓什麼？

115
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,100
I have no idea, dear. She was the nanny.
我不知道，親愛的 她只是個奶媽

116
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:29,780
As great as she was, I can't afford that.
她真的很棒 我出不起那筆錢

117
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:33,950
I'm sorry. Sometimes I forget not everyone has alimony.
抱歉 有時我忘了不是大家都有贍養費

118
00:07:36,150 --> 00:07:37,980
-Oh, Rachel! -What?
-瑞秋 -什麼？

119
00:07:38,150 --> 00:07:42,110
I just had a great idea! I'm gonna come live with you!
我想到一個好點子 我要搬過去跟你們住

120
00:07:42,790 --> 00:07:44,780
What? What?
什麼？

121
00:07:44,990 --> 00:07:49,660
Oh, I'm so happy I'm gonna do this for my little girl.
我很高興 我能幫我女兒這個忙

122
00:07:49,830 --> 00:07:53,290
Look at you. You have tears in your eyes.
看看你 你感動的都快哭了

123
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:57,630
Yes, yes, I do.
沒錯，我是快哭了

124
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:00,770
Ross, you're in the lead.
羅斯，現在是你領先

125
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:04,270
Would you like to take another question or spin the Wheel of Mayhem?
你要再回答一題 或旋轉處罰輪？

126
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:08,210
The Wheel has not been my friend tonight, Joey.
今天我轉輪子的運氣不太好 喬伊

127
00:08:08,380 --> 00:08:10,210
I'll take another question.
我要再回答一題

128
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:12,580
Okay. This is gonna be tough. Hold your breath.
好吧，這題很難 仔細聽好了

129
00:08:12,790 --> 00:08:14,550
It's okay. I'm ready.
沒關係，我準備好了

130
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,690
You gotta hold your breath until you answer.
你得注意聽 再回答問題

131
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:20,880
This is ridiculous! He's not gonna hold his..
這太可笑了，他沒辦法注意…

132
00:08:22,230 --> 00:08:28,500
Okay. What do you have a fear of if you suffer from this phobia? Triska..
好吧，如果你害怕恐懼的感覺 那該怎麼說？懼…

133
00:08:28,670 --> 00:08:32,770
Holy cow. That's a big word. Trisk..
天啊，那個字真長，懼…

134
00:08:32,940 --> 00:08:35,410
Look at this. How do you say that?
看看這個，它該怎麼念？

135
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:38,670
-Let me see that. -This one right here.
-讓我看看 -就是這個字

136
00:08:39,710 --> 00:08:42,550
-Triskaidekaphobia. -Fear of Triscuits!
-懼13症 -害怕樹上

137
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:47,120
-No! No. Fear of the number 13. -Fear of Triscuits?
-不，是害怕13 -害怕樹上？

138
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:50,760
It's possible. They have really sharp edges.
這有可能 它們真的都尖尖的

139
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:53,590
Chandler, you're up.
錢德，輪到你了

140
00:08:53,830 --> 00:08:57,390
I'm entitled to use my Angel Pass for a free turn.
我要用天使通行證 換免費的機會

141
00:08:57,670 --> 00:09:01,570
Yes, yes. But you can only use it once, so choose wisely.
對，但你只能使用一次 請考慮清楚

142
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:04,060
This is tricky.
這真的很難決定

143
00:09:05,070 --> 00:09:09,740
I mean, I am in the lead, but I would love another shot at the Golden Monkey.
現在是我領先 但我想再試一次金猴

144
00:09:10,950 --> 00:09:15,250
-This game makes no sense! -You're upset because you're losing.
-這個遊戲真的很沒有道理 -你很生氣是因為你輸了

145
00:09:15,450 --> 00:09:19,390
Oh, come on, Ross. I think we're all losers here.
少來了，羅斯 我想我們都是失敗者

146
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:22,960
I would like to hang on to my Angel Pass please.
我想用 我的天使通行證

147
00:09:23,260 --> 00:09:27,020
You can either spin the Wheel or pick a Google Card.
你可以選輪子 或選張搜索牌

148
00:09:27,190 --> 00:09:30,790
Let me think, let me think. Oh, I don't care.
讓我想想 我不在乎

149
00:09:32,770 --> 00:09:34,430
You must choose.
你非選不可

150
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:38,970
-Either. It makes no difference. -Choose, you jackass.
-那還是沒有差別 -快選吧，混蛋

151
00:09:39,970 --> 00:09:43,310
-I'll take a card. -You picked the Gimme Card!
-我要抽卡片 -你選到了給我卡

152
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:46,910
-You get all of Ross' points! -What?
-你拿到羅斯所有的分數 -什麼？

153
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:50,310
This game is kind of fun!
這個遊戲開始好玩起來了

154
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:53,610
You don't think it's crazy that you get my points..?
你不覺得你拿到我的分數 太瘋狂了…

155
00:09:53,820 --> 00:09:57,780
The contestants aren't supposed to speak to each other.
參賽者 不該交談的

156
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:02,590
Now, do you wanna start opening presents..
你要開始 拆禮物了嗎？

157
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:05,530
because it seems like people are getting itchy to leave.
因為大家 似乎急著想離開

158
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:07,330
And when I say people, I mean me.
我說大家 指的是我自己

159
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:14,300
-Why did you invite my mother? -What?
-你為什麼要邀請我媽來？ -什麼？

160
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:17,770
She wants to move in with me and Ross to help take care of the baby.
她要搬過來跟我和羅斯住 以便幫忙照顧寶寶

161
00:10:18,010 --> 00:10:20,340
-For how long? -Eight weeks.
-多久？ -八星期

162
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:25,080
I love my mother, but, my God, a long lunch with her is taxing.
我愛我媽，但是天啊 跟她一起吃午餐太久就是種折磨

163
00:10:25,290 --> 00:10:28,280
I'd be honored if she wanted to live with me.
如果她想跟我住 我會覺得很光榮

164
00:10:28,490 --> 00:10:31,010
She can't hear you.
她聽不到

165
00:10:32,190 --> 00:10:33,850
What am I gonna do?
我該怎麼樣？

166
00:10:34,060 --> 00:10:37,900
If you don't want her to move in with you, just tell her.
如果不希望她搬過去 你該直說的

167
00:10:38,070 --> 00:10:41,030
You're right. I'm about to have a baby.
你說的對 我就快生了

168
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:44,400
I can say I don't want her sleeping on my couch.
我可以說我不希望 她睡在沙發上

169
00:10:44,570 --> 00:10:47,870
She'll wanna sleep in my bed. This can't happen.
她會睡在我床上 絕不能讓那種事發生

170
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,300
That is right.
沒錯

171
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:52,280
Tell her you don't want her to live with you.
告訴她 你不希望她搬過去跟你們住

172
00:10:52,450 --> 00:10:54,810
Do not take no for an answer.
別讓她拒絕你

173
00:10:55,750 --> 00:11:00,410
This is great! Now she's gonna be mad at Rachel!
這真的太棒了 現在她會生瑞秋的氣

174
00:11:00,590 --> 00:11:05,720
And I'm just gonna swoop in there and be like the daughter she never had.
我要跑過去 當她的乖女兒討好她

175
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:07,620
Oh, honey, you have to let it go.
甜心 你得忘了這件事

176
00:11:08,930 --> 00:11:10,290
Okay.
好吧

177
00:11:12,030 --> 00:11:14,130
Who doesn't accept an apology?
誰不會接受道歉呢？

178
00:11:14,300 --> 00:11:15,860
I mean, it's just so simple.
那真的很簡單

179
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:18,300
"I'm sorry, Sandra." "That's okay, Monica.
「對不起，珊卓拉」 「沒關係，摩妮卡」

180
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:19,630
I forgive you.
我原諒你

181
00:11:19,810 --> 00:11:21,640
And by the way, you're very pretty."
還有，你非常漂亮

182
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:28,080
I have new respect for Chandler.
我真的要很尊敬錢德了

183
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:32,620
All right, everybody! It's time to open the presents!
好了，大伙們 該來拆禮物了

184
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:35,760
Yes! The first gift that Rachel opens..
對 瑞秋要拆的第一樣禮物…

185
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,390
should be from the grandmother.
應該是外婆送的禮物

186
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:44,500
Because you're the most important person in this room! And in the world!
因為你是這裡最重要的人 也是全世界最重要的

187
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:48,060
I don't have a gift because I wasn't invited until the last minute.
我沒有準備禮物 因為我在最後一分鐘才被邀請

188
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:53,260
But thank you so much, dear, for bringing that to everybody's attention.
但非常謝謝你，親愛的 讓大家都注意到這一點

189
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:59,840
How about you less important people? Let's open your presents!
你們這些不重要的人呢？ 我們來拆你們的禮物吧

190
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:04,680
-It's okay that you didn't get a gift. -I kind of did.
-你沒準備禮物也沒關係 -但我也算是送了你一樣禮物

191
00:12:04,850 --> 00:12:07,250
Me! Eight weeks of me.
我要跟你同住八個星期

192
00:12:07,420 --> 00:12:11,260
Okay. See, Mom, the truth is, I can do this on my own.
好吧，媽媽 事實上我可以自己照顧寶寶

193
00:12:11,430 --> 00:12:14,190
I know you're gonna be a terrific mom.
我知道你會是個好媽媽

194
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:17,300
But you need help at the beginning.
但一開始你需要幫忙

195
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:20,160
I know what I'm doing. I can handle it.
我知道我在做什麼 我應付得來

196
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:22,170
Really? Remember Twinkles?
真的嗎？還記得亮亮嗎？

197
00:12:22,370 --> 00:12:26,330
He was a hamster. I'm not gonna vacuum up my baby!
他是只倉鼠 我不會拿吸塵器吸我的寶寶

198
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:29,840
Okay, come on, Rach. It's present time!
快來吧，瑞秋 拆禮物的時間到了

199
00:12:30,010 --> 00:12:33,000
You're the glue holding this party together.
你是 這個派對的主角

200
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:36,480
It's kind of falling apart here.
現在這個派對也快毀了

201
00:12:36,650 --> 00:12:38,850
-Oh, look! -Wow!
-你看 -哇

202
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,880
This is from your friends at work.
這是你同事送的

203
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:46,620
Oh, my gosh! Oh, wow! Oh, I know what this is.
天啊，哇 我知道這是什麼

204
00:12:46,790 --> 00:12:48,630
Wait a minute.
等一下

205
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:51,770
That can't be right.
不可能

206
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:55,560
Is that a beer bong for a baby?
這是寶寶的啤酒機嗎？

207
00:12:56,540 --> 00:12:58,870
Darling, that's a breast pump.
女兒，那是擠奶器

208
00:13:00,170 --> 00:13:05,810
Did I say I was done guessing? Okay, thank you for that.
我說過我不再猜了嗎？ 好吧，謝謝

209
00:13:06,050 --> 00:13:08,570
Oh, wow! What's this?
哇，這是什麼？

210
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:12,220
-It's a Diaper Genie. -It dispenses clean diapers!
-它是尿布精靈 -它是用來放乾淨尿布的

211
00:13:12,420 --> 00:13:14,480
It's where you put dirty ones.
那是放髒尿布的

212
00:13:14,860 --> 00:13:18,690
Why don't you take it outside and throw it in a dumpster?
我為什麼不直接 把尿布丟在外面的垃圾桶？

213
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:23,890
-You're gonna do that 10 times a day? -What, it goes 10 times a day?
-你每天要丟十次嗎？ -什麼？寶寶一天可以拉十次？

214
00:13:24,060 --> 00:13:26,590
Are we feeding this baby Indian food?
我們得餵她印度食物嗎？

215
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:29,930
No, dear. That's what babies do.
不，寶寶都是那樣的

216
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:34,540
Rachel, listen to your mother. She is very smart.
瑞秋，聽你媽媽的話 她非常聰明

217
00:13:35,610 --> 00:13:40,440
What will you do with the baby while you trot out to the garbage?
你去倒垃圾桶時 寶寶要放在哪裡？

218
00:13:41,050 --> 00:13:44,610
I don't know, I'd leave it on the changing table?
我不知道 把她放在尿布台上？

219
00:13:44,850 --> 00:13:49,850
-What? What did I do? What did I do? -You can't leave a baby alone.
-什麼？我做了什麼？ -你不能丟下寶寶一個人

220
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:51,750
Of course, I know that!
我當然知道

221
00:13:51,930 --> 00:13:54,790
Of course you never leave a baby alone.
千萬不能 丟下寶寶一個人

222
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,400
It would.. She wouldn't be safe.
它會… 她會不安全

223
00:13:57,830 --> 00:14:01,770
Not as safe as she would be with me, the baby dummy.
她跟我這個菜鳥媽媽在一起 也不會安全

224
00:14:01,940 --> 00:14:05,770
Opening the presents is a little overwhelming right now.
現在拆禮物 太刺激了

225
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:09,380
I'm gonna maybe open them all a little bit later.
我待會 會把它們都拆開

226
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:12,070
Thank you for coming, for the gifts..
謝謝你們趕來 還送了禮物…

227
00:14:12,250 --> 00:14:17,710
-and this basket is beautiful. -It's actually a bassinet.
-這個籃子很漂亮 -它是搖籃

228
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:21,120
Okay, Mommy, don't ever leave me.
好吧，媽媽，別離開我

229
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:27,160
In what film would you hear this line: "We don't need no stinking badges!"
你會在哪電影聽到這句台詞？ 「我們不需要臭警徽」

230
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:30,300
-Treasure of the Sierra Madre! -Correct! Backwards Bonus.
-《碧血金沙》 -答對了，倒念還能加分

231
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:34,030
-Madre Sierra the of Treasure! -Yes!
-沙金血碧 -對

232
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:36,030
What? There's extra points for that?
什麼？那樣子可以加分？

233
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,900
Fair not that's!
平公不

234
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:41,400
I'd like to go up the Ladder of Chance to the Golden Mud Hut!
我要爬上機會梯 到金泥屋去

235
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:43,910
-Wise choice. How many rungs? -Six!
-聰明的選擇，幾階？ -六階

236
00:14:45,150 --> 00:14:49,550
-That noise can only mean one thing. -Hungry Monkey!
-那個聲音只代表一個意思 -飢餓的猴子

237
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:53,950
-I'd like a Wicked Wango Card. -It's an audio question.
-我要魔法機會牌 -這是聲音題

238
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:57,890
Name this television theme song:
說出這出電視劇的主題曲

239
00:14:59,430 --> 00:15:02,360
Oh, my God. I know this. Give me a second.
天啊，我知道 讓我想一想

240
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,590
-Tell it to the Time Turtle! -Shut up!
-去跟時間烏龜說吧 -閉嘴

241
00:15:04,770 --> 00:15:06,890
-"I Dream of Jeannie"! -Yes! Back in the lead!
-《太空仙女戀》 -答對了，你再度領先

242
00:15:07,070 --> 00:15:09,370
I'd like to spin the Wheel.
我要轉輪子

243
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:16,940
Oh, come on!
快點

244
00:15:17,110 --> 00:15:18,810
Super Speedy Speed Round.
超級快速回合

245
00:15:18,980 --> 00:15:21,780
-Is there a Hopping Bonus? -Of course.
-跳躍有加分嗎？ -當然

246
00:15:25,250 --> 00:15:27,480
-Who invented bifocals? -Ben Franklin!
-誰發明了雙焦點透鏡？ -班法蘭克林

247
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:30,490
Correct. Which monarch ruled Great Britain the longest?
答對了 哪個君王統治英國最久？

248
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:31,950
Queen Victoria!
維多莉亞女王

249
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:36,390
You forgot to switch legs between questions. No Hopping Bonus!
你忘了換題時要換腿跳 跳躍動作沒加分

250
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:38,760
Every time!
每次都這樣

251
00:15:38,930 --> 00:15:42,930
-Yeah. Now over to Chandler. -I'd like a Google Card.
-對，現在輪到錢德了 -我要搜索卡

252
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:47,800
-Are you sure? -Yes! No! Google!
-你確定？ -對，不，搜索卡

253
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:53,140
Oh, my God! Congratulations, Ross! Because, Chandler..
天啊，恭喜你，羅斯 因為錢德…

254
00:15:53,310 --> 00:15:55,480
-you've been Bamboozled! -No!
-你已經出局了 -不

255
00:15:55,680 --> 00:16:01,090
-Yes! -This is the best game ever!
-對 -這是我玩過最棒的遊戲

256
00:16:01,820 --> 00:16:04,290
You'll stay as long as I need you?
只要我有需要，你就會留下來？

257
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:07,120
-Of course. -I swear I'm not an idiot.
-當然 -我發誓我不是白癡

258
00:16:07,290 --> 00:16:10,290
I read books on pregnancy and giving birth.
我看了 懷孕跟生產的書

259
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:14,800
I didn't think to read about what to do when the baby comes.
我沒有看 帶孩子的書

260
00:16:14,970 --> 00:16:16,660
And the baby's coming..
寶寶出生後…

261
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:21,930
and I don't know what to do. Oh, can I throw up in my Diaper Genie?
我不知道我該怎麼辦 我可以吐在尿布精靈裡嗎？

262
00:16:22,110 --> 00:16:25,170
Sweetie, you're gonna be fine.
甜心，你會沒事的

263
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:28,610
-Where you going? -I'm going to the bathroom.
-你要去哪裡？ -我得上洗手間

264
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:33,620
Now, don't worry. Everything's gonna be okay.
別擔心 一切都會沒事的

265
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:36,650
It is gonna be okay!
會沒事的

266
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:42,960
Worth a shot.
這值得一試

267
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:47,700
Hey! Why are you all red and sweaty?
你幹嘛滿臉通紅全身是汗？

268
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:50,440
I just Bamboozled Chandler!
我剛剛幹掉了錢德

269
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:55,840
Which is not a sexual thing.
我沒有對他不軌

270
00:16:57,850 --> 00:17:01,980
-Well, that was a quick shower. -Not if you were here.
-歡迎會這麼快就結束了 -因為你沒來

271
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:04,350
Looks like we got a lot of good stuff.
看來我們收到不少好禮物

272
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:07,320
We did. My mom got us the greatest gift of all.
沒錯 我媽送給我們最棒的禮物

273
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,490
A Play-Doh Barbershop?
培樂多理髮師工具組？

274
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:14,750
No. She's going to live with us for eight weeks.
不，她要搬過來 跟我們住八星期

275
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:16,390
What?
什麼？

276
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:20,400
Yes! She's gonna help us take care of the baby!
對 她要幫我們照顧寶寶

277
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:23,430
You're not serious!
你不是認真的

278
00:17:23,600 --> 00:17:27,840
She's a very nice woman, but we can't take eight weeks of her.
她是個好人 但我們無法忍受她八個星期

279
00:17:28,010 --> 00:17:30,200
-She'll drive us crazy.. -Hi, Ross!
-她會把我們逼瘋… -嗨，羅斯

280
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:32,570
Hey, roomie!
嘿，室友

281
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:41,720
Hey, I'm Ray. I'm the producer of the show.
喬伊，我是雷 本節目的製作人

282
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:45,050
It's a pleasure to meet you, Ray.
很榮幸能見到你，雷

283
00:17:45,230 --> 00:17:49,490
This is Duncan and Erin. They're gonna help with the audition.
他們是唐肯跟艾玲 他們會幫你試鏡

284
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:53,690
-Right, Ray. -Whenever you're ready.
-對，雷 -你準備好了就開始

285
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:58,430
Hello. I'm Joey Tribbiani. Let's play Bamboozled!
哈囉，我是喬伊崔比亞尼 我們來玩暈頭轉向吧

286
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:03,270
Erin, first question. In hockey, who is known as "The Great One"?
艾玲，第一個問題，在曲棍球史上 誰被稱為是「偉人」？

287
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,710
-Gretzky. -Correct!
-葛瑞斯基 -答對了

288
00:18:04,910 --> 00:18:08,780
Want to pick a Wicked Wango Card or spin the Wheel?
你要挑魔法機會卡 或轉輪子？

289
00:18:09,020 --> 00:18:12,210
Didn't your agents give you the revised rules?
你的經紀人沒有給你 改變過的遊戲規則嗎？

290
00:18:12,390 --> 00:18:15,450
We've eliminated all that. No wheel. No cards.
我們把那些東西都刪掉了 沒有輪子或機會卡

291
00:18:15,620 --> 00:18:17,610
Why?
為什麼？

292
00:18:17,790 --> 00:18:21,960
It was too complicated. People didn't follow it.
那太複雜了 觀眾沒辦法瞭解

293
00:18:22,130 --> 00:18:26,120
Complicated?! Spin the Wheel to go up the Ladder of Chance..
複雜？ 轉輪子上機會梯…

294
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:29,630
through the Rainbow Ring to the Golden Monkey.
穿越彩虹環 找金猴

295
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:32,970
You yank his tail, and you're in Paradise Pond!
拉它的尾巴 就能到天堂池

296
00:18:33,610 --> 00:18:35,840
Yeah. All that's gone.
對，那些都刪掉了

297
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:39,100
It's a simple question-and-answer game now.
現在這只是個 簡單的問答遊戲

298
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:41,510
Well, what's fun about that?
那有什麼好玩的呢？

299
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:46,180
You expect me to host a boring game of people answering questions?
你要我主持 觀眾回答問題的無聊遊戲？

300
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:49,150
Women in bikinis hold up the scores.
會有比基尼女郎拿得分板

301
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:52,290
Let's play Bamboozled!
我們來玩暈頭轉向吧

302
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:55,620
So I thought we'd put the changing station in the living room.
我想我們該把尿布台 放在客廳裡

303
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:59,230
I thought I'd bring in my decorator because I feel like I'm at my best..
我想請我的設計師過來 因為我覺得我最擅長…

304
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:01,330
when surrounded by jewel tones.
把房子弄得珠光寶氣

305
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:04,890
Sure, who doesn't?
當然，誰不是呢？

306
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:09,700
Oh, and all those dinosaur knickknacks you have..
你買的那些 恐龍小玩意…

307
00:19:09,910 --> 00:19:12,110
they might be more at home in the garage.
它們或許比較適合 放在車庫裡

308
00:19:12,410 --> 00:19:17,780
-Well, we don't have a garage. -Did I say garage? I meant garbage.
-我們沒有車庫 -我說車庫嗎？我是說垃圾桶

309
00:19:18,950 --> 00:19:23,950
You know what? Maybe it's not absolutely vital that you live with us.
你知道嗎？ 或許你不一定要跟我們住在一起

310
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:29,650
-Well, Rachel needs help with the baby. -I really do. I don't know anything.
-瑞秋需要人幫忙帶孩子 -真的，我什麼都不會

311
00:19:30,060 --> 00:19:31,720
I'm sure that's not true.
我相信那不是真的

312
00:19:31,930 --> 00:19:34,770
Oh, no? Do I know anything about babies?
是嗎？ 我會帶孩子嗎？

313
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:38,000
-No. Not a thing. -It's frightening.
-不 -那真的很可怕

314
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:41,300
Even if she doesn't know anything, I do.
就算她不會 但是我會

315
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:43,600
And I'll be there to show her.
我會教她

316
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:46,950
That's exactly what Rachel's father told me.
瑞秋的爸爸 也是那麼告訴我

317
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:49,340
Know what he said at the first 3 a.m. feeding?
你知道第一次半夜三點起來餵奶 他說什麼嗎？

318
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:51,750
"I'm tired. You take care of it."
「我累了，交給你吧」

319
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:54,550
Which I later said to him when he wanted to have sex.
後來他想跟我求歡時 我也是那麼告訴他

320
00:19:59,690 --> 00:20:01,920
Well, I'm not Rachel's dad.
我不是瑞秋的爸爸

321
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:04,530
And no offense, but he's an ass.
我沒有惡意 但他是個混蛋

322
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,930
I do like you, Ross.
我真的喜歡你，羅斯

323
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:13,000
I have a son. His mother and I didn't live together.
我有個兒子 他媽媽跟我沒有住在一起

324
00:20:13,170 --> 00:20:17,700
When he was with me, I took care of him all the time, by myself.
他跟我一起住時 我都是自己照顧他

325
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:21,040
-That's true. You do have another child. -Yeah.
-沒錯，你還有一個孩子 -對

326
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:23,010
With another woman.
跟另一個女人生的

327
00:20:23,220 --> 00:20:26,550
Have you no control, Ross?
你沒有自制力嗎？羅斯

328
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:31,050
That's a different issue.
那是另一個問題

329
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:36,430
The point is, when the baby comes, I will be there to feed her..
重點是寶寶出生後 我會幫忙餵她…

330
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:38,960
and bathe her and change her.
幫她洗澡換尿布

331
00:20:39,130 --> 00:20:42,470
I want to do all those things.
我願意照顧她

332
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:47,230
-You don't need me to live with you. -Yes!
-你們不需要我搬過去 -對

333
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:51,410
Yes. You're gonna be so missed.
對，我會想念你的

334
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:55,910
-You'll be a great father. -You'll be a wonderful grandma.
-你會是個好爸爸 -你會是個好外婆

335
00:20:56,280 --> 00:21:00,280
Hello? I still don't know what the hell I'm doing!
哈囉 我還是不知道我該做什麼

336
00:21:00,490 --> 00:21:03,790
Every first-time mother feels that way.
新手媽媽 都會有那種感覺

337
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:09,950
You're gonna pick it up. Hey, you will. Look, when you first came to the city..
你可以慢慢學，你會的 當你剛到紐約來時…

338
00:21:10,130 --> 00:21:15,470
you were a spoiled, helpless little girl who used Daddy's credit cards!
你是個被寵壞的無助小女孩 只會用爸爸的信用卡

339
00:21:15,900 --> 00:21:18,670
I hope you're going somewhere with this.
我希望 你真的有話要告訴我

340
00:21:18,870 --> 00:21:21,670
Look at you. You're this big executive.
看看你 你現在是個大主管

341
00:21:21,910 --> 00:21:24,600
You are more capable than you give yourself credit for.
你很能幹 證明了自己的能力

342
00:21:24,810 --> 00:21:28,940
I have no doubt you're gonna be an incredible mother.
我相信 你會是個好媽媽

343
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:32,310
-Really? -I'm telling you.
-真的嗎？ -沒錯

344
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:35,120
Thank you.
謝謝

345
00:21:37,490 --> 00:21:39,930
All right. I'm gonna get going.
好吧，我得走了

346
00:21:40,460 --> 00:21:42,450
No, sweetheart, stay put.
不，甜心，別送了

347
00:21:42,660 --> 00:21:47,760
I'll let myself out. It's like I'm not here. Which I almost wasn't.
我自己出去，就當我沒來過這裡 我差點真的來不了

348
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:54,040
You're just so funny. You're so funny. What do I do?
你真的太幽默了 我做了什麼？

349
00:21:54,410 --> 00:21:58,280
Nothing. You have apologized to her, like, a million times.
沒什麼 你跟她道歉很多次

350
00:21:58,450 --> 00:22:01,540
And she's been nothing but terrible to you.
她只是 無視你的道歉

351
00:22:01,780 --> 00:22:07,020
You just threw her daughter a lovely, albeit slightly boring, shower.
你讓她女兒辦了 一個可愛無聊的歡迎會

352
00:22:07,190 --> 00:22:12,280
-And she hasn't even thanked you for it. -You know what? You're right.
-她甚至沒有謝謝你 -你知道嗎？你說的對

353
00:22:12,530 --> 00:22:15,650
If you wanna say anything, I'd tell her off.
如果你有話要說 快告訴她

354
00:22:15,830 --> 00:22:17,300
Really?
真的嗎？

355
00:22:18,730 --> 00:22:21,030
Okay, I will.
好吧，我會的

356
00:22:21,230 --> 00:22:23,570
Mrs. Green?
葛林太太

357
00:22:23,840 --> 00:22:25,300
Mrs. Green?
葛林太太

358
00:22:25,470 --> 00:22:28,370
It is rude to leave a party without saying goodbye to the host.
不跟主人道別 就離開派對是很無禮的

359
00:22:28,580 --> 00:22:33,410
When someone apologizes to you, the decent thing to do is to accept it.
如果有人跟你道歉 你得接受

360
00:22:33,580 --> 00:22:35,840
What I did wasn't on purpose.
我不是故意要那麼做的

361
00:22:36,020 --> 00:22:39,680
But what you're doing to me now is plain spiteful.
但你對我的態度 太可恥了

362
00:22:39,890 --> 00:22:41,220
-Spiteful? -That's right.
-可恥？ -沒錯

363
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:45,360
It's time you took a good look in the mirror, young lady!
你該好好去照鏡子 小姑娘

364
00:22:45,530 --> 00:22:47,250
Old lady!
老太婆

365
00:22:47,460 --> 00:22:49,260
Lady!
女士

366
00:22:49,460 --> 00:22:52,330
Wrap it up. Wrap it up. Wrap it up.
別說了

367
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:57,190
So whenever you're ready to apologize to me, I will forgive you.
只要你準備好跟我道歉 我會原諒你

368
00:22:57,370 --> 00:22:59,700
Good day.
再見

369
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:04,600
I can't feel my legs!
我的腳沒有感覺

370
00:23:05,380 --> 00:23:08,280
You were fantastic! I'm so proud of you.
你真的太棒了 我非常以你為榮

371
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:12,510
-Yeah? I'm proud of me too. -You should be.
-是嗎？我也以自己為榮 -你應該的

372
00:23:12,750 --> 00:23:17,190
-Could you get me something to drink? -You got it!
-你能幫我拿杯飲料嗎？ -沒問題

373
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:22,230
Mrs. Green? Okay, I'm really sorry! I apologize. If you..
葛林太太，我真的很抱歉 對不起，如果你…

374
00:23:23,630 --> 00:23:26,900
Okay! I bit my tongue!
好吧，我咬到舌頭了

375
00:23:27,070 --> 00:23:30,400
But I'm still really sorry!
但我真的很抱歉

376
00:23:36,380 --> 00:23:38,440
-Okay, I'm ready. -You sure?
-好吧，我準備好了 -你確定？

377
00:23:38,650 --> 00:23:41,580
I've done my studying, and I know my stuff.
我看過書 把一切都弄清楚了

378
00:23:41,820 --> 00:23:43,940
All right, then.
好吧

379
00:23:45,390 --> 00:23:48,250
Rachel Green, let's play Bamboozled!
瑞秋葛林 我們來玩暈頭轉向

380
00:23:48,890 --> 00:23:51,620
How do you test the temperature of the baby's bath water?
你該如何測試 寶寶洗澡水的溫度？

381
00:23:51,830 --> 00:23:53,920
-Put your elbow in it. -Excellent!
-用手肘去試 -非常好

382
00:23:54,130 --> 00:23:58,330
-How do you put a baby down for a nap? -Full, dry, on its back, no loose covers.
-如何讓寶寶小睡一下？ -餵飽她，換干尿布，趴睡，被子蓋緊

383
00:23:58,500 --> 00:23:59,730
Correct!
答對了

384
00:23:59,900 --> 00:24:02,930
There's a hopping bonus here, but I don't suggest you take it.
這題有跳躍加分 我不建議你那麼做

385
00:24:03,300 --> 00:24:04,530
Okay.
好吧

386
00:24:05,070 --> 00:24:10,700
This is an audio question. What do you do when a baby makes this sound:
這題是聲音題 寶寶發出這種聲音時你該怎麼辦？

387
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:16,670
Check if it's wet or hungry, burp it.
檢查她是尿濕或餓了，幫她拍背

388
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:21,820
Excellent! Now do you want another question or a Wicked Wango Card?
太棒了，你要再回答一題 或抽魔法機會牌？

389
00:24:22,060 --> 00:24:25,460
-A card! A card! I pick a card! -Oh, I'm sorry.
-我要抽牌 -對不起

390
00:24:25,630 --> 00:24:30,820
You've been Bamboozled! You're gonna be a terrible mother!
你出局了 你會是個爛媽媽

391
00:24:32,800 --> 00:24:35,500
I've lost sight of why we're doing this!
我忘記我們為什麼要這麼做了

392
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:40,170
Please don't walk away.
請不要走開

393
00:24:41,580 --> 00:24:43,540
I've gone too far.
我說得太過火了

394
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


395
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

